{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/cded50009e230e8d156bc23955dbd7b1.poster.avif?t=1774262617\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/cded50009e230e8d156bc23955dbd7b1.webm?t=1774262617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/cded50009e230e8d156bc23955dbd7b1.mp4?t=1774262617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>A Sacrifice...</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>For an unknown reason, you leave this world before your time. Then, as a golden opportunity, you are reborn by the Moon Goddess herself! But why does the goddess looks so sad?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/9dc5c35c5f4edc4f8cb157f91c2705df.poster.avif?t=1774262617\" width=816 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/9dc5c35c5f4edc4f8cb157f91c2705df.webm?t=1774262617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/9dc5c35c5f4edc4f8cb157f91c2705df.mp4?t=1774262617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>A New Life!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>There are many activities in Heaven's Dale! Build your own ranch, make repairs, grow a garden, explore dark caves, raise seahorses, or spend the day fishing to sharpen your skills!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/18f76a28685729f19b271655e1b15617.poster.avif?t=1774262617\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/18f76a28685729f19b271655e1b15617.webm?t=1774262617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/18f76a28685729f19b271655e1b15617.mp4?t=1774262617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>That's Not All...</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore a brand new world, the Purple Moon! Uncover what happened in Heaven\u2019s Dale, and who you truly are!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/2c2e255f7c9e2ed480a51d86b96237d6.poster.avif?t=1774262617\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/2c2e255f7c9e2ed480a51d86b96237d6.webm?t=1774262617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/2c2e255f7c9e2ed480a51d86b96237d6.mp4?t=1774262617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Something Isn't Right...</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The former owner disappeared? You can see the dead? What is happening in the world beyond Heaven\u2019s Dale? Who are the dwarves?</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/25a6821496cabfcf8a4a0f24a8f5e2a9.webp?t=1774262617\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/25a6821496cabfcf8a4a0f24a8f5e2a9.poster.avif?t=1774262617\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1128 height=320 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Many Goals!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Is the Moon Temple destroyed? Embark on a mission to help the Moon Fairies restore the goddess!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/b5237a0040bbb8599523f53210fc83dd.poster.avif?t=1774262617\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/b5237a0040bbb8599523f53210fc83dd.webm?t=1774262617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/b5237a0040bbb8599523f53210fc83dd.mp4?t=1774262617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>You're Not Alone!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Befriend the residents of Heaven\u2019s Dale! And maybe one day, you might build a family of your own!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/cffc942a7372788ec2f6e4bfeff3b2aa.avif?t=1774262617\" width=725 height=241 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/f6078a07593423e4747ca20c163452e7.avif?t=1774262617\" width=739 height=207 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>More about!</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources and repair structures across Heaven\u2019s Dale</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant seeds and watch your garden come to life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise animals and build your own ranch life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch over 95 fish and complete your collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the journal and uncover the fate of the former owner</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Care for a unique seahorse ranch in the ocean</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect furniture and decorate your home your way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests to unlock new areas, items, and secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get married and start a family</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Made with Love!</i></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/000ed13d42e09cd795aed9a6fe81efc7.poster.avif?t=1774262617\" width=1060 height=594 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/000ed13d42e09cd795aed9a6fe81efc7.webm?t=1774262617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/000ed13d42e09cd795aed9a6fe81efc7.mp4?t=1774262617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>&quot;My Heaven\u2019s Dale started as a casual experiment in 2024. At the beginning, I had zero experience with both art and programming. People started to enjoy what I was making, so I decided to pursue the project as a true a