ur collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the journal and uncover the fate of the former owner</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Care for a unique seahorse ranch in the ocean</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect furniture and decorate your home your way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests to unlock new areas, items, and secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get married and start a family</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Made with Love!</i></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/000ed13d42e09cd795aed9a6fe81efc7.poster.avif?t=1774262617\" width=1060 height=594 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/000ed13d42e09cd795aed9a6fe81efc7.webm?t=1774262617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/000ed13d42e09cd795aed9a6fe81efc7.mp4?t=1774262617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>&quot;My Heaven\u2019s Dale started as a casual experiment in 2024. At the beginning, I had zero experience with both art and programming. People started to enjoy what I was making, so I decided to pursue the project as a true ambition in my life.&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/48c3923b56df7bda2046a0ceaeb90ead.avif?t=1774262617\" width=678 height=248 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["DreamingCat"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"de